Map of what anyone (human or agent) working here needs to know.

**The code is the source.** Where something lives comes from searching the
code, starting from something that already exists; why a line is the way it
is sits in a comment beside it; a rule between two distant places is a test.
A document holds only what no file can say — the state in `ESTADO.md`, a
measured fact, a known defect — in the present, with no counts and no
history (`git log` keeps it). Files stay small, one subject each.

